    "extract": "Nina Makino-Hillman, also known professionally as Nina Makino , Nina Hillman , and mononymously as Nina (ニナ), is an American singer and former child actress based in Japan. She is a member of the Japanese girl group NiziU.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Nina Makino-Hillman</b>, also known professionally as <b>Nina Makino</b><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"> </span>, <b>Nina Hillman</b><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"> </span>, and mononymously as <b>Nina</b><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"> (ニナ)</span>, is an American singer and former child actress based in Japan. She is a member of the Japanese girl group NiziU.</p>"
